VALUES ('leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co/<CAJJpzSHRqB32RlDrDy2t2WCVuJkOmMr2sKoQuBV@mail.gmail.com>', 'leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co/1856965916492755786', 'leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co', '["INBOX", "IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"]', 'Hi Leonard, Robert, Arthur, Thanks for signing today. Before we can deliver the licensed data set, these accounts need to stay active with t', 1770940701000, '2026-02-12T23:58:21Z', 1764, 'Harmony Games – data delivery checklist', 'PERSON_7731_EMAIL', 'PERSON_7731_NAME', '["leonard hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co>"]', '["robert <robert@harmonygames.co>", "arthur blake <arthur.blake@harmonygames.co>"]', '[]', '[]', E'Hi Leonard, Robert, Arthur,\n\nThanks for signing today. Before we can deliver the licensed data set, these accounts need to stay active with their full history and every user in place until we confirm delivery: Slack (stay on the paid plan — the free plan hides history older than 90 days), Google Workspace (every user account, including former staff — please don''t archive or delete any), Figma, Linear, GitHub and Metabase. Nothing on this list should be closed, downgraded or archived before the delivery review call Leonard booked with us. Accounts that aren''t on the list aren''t part of the licensed bundle, so close them whenever suits you.\n\nFor Helpshift, please export the full ticket history to Drive before your subscription ends.\n\nIf our engineers change anything on this list, we''ll reply on this thread.\n\nBest,\nMaya\nClient onboarding, Sunset', NULL, '[{"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAJJpzSHRqB32RlDrDy2t2WCVuJkOmMr2sKoQuBV@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Thu, 12 Feb 2026 23:58:21 +0000"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Harmony Games – data delivery checklist"}, {"name": "From", "value": "PERSON_7731_NAME <PERSON_7731_EMAIL>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "leonard hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co>"}, {"name": "Cc", "value": "robert <robert@harmonygames.co>, arthur blake <arthur.blake@harmonygames.co>"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]');
